{"id":"83e0b1063552231c","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-locally-integrable-data.md","title":"欧氏开集上的实局部可积函数","display":"df-locally-integrable-data — 欧氏开集上的实局部可积函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-locally-integrable-data","aliases":["58-df-locally-integrable-data"],"display":"df-locally-integrable-data — 欧氏开集上的实局部可积函数","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-locally-integrable-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-locally-integrable-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-locally-integrable-data — 欧氏开集上的实局部可积函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 为标准实数 Borel 集族；非负积分值采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a,b]_n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)\\le x(i)\\le b(i))\\}\">\\([a,b]_n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)\\le x(i)\\le b(i))\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\">\\(L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\)</span> 均为代表函数层的定义，不是几乎处处等价类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_K,\\lambda_K\">\\(\\mathcal B_K,\\lambda_K\\)</span> 对每个 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 按同一限制规则确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)&lt;b(i)))\\land[a,b]_n\\subseteq\\Omega\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,\\{\\langle x,|f(x)|\\rangle:x\\in[a,b]_n\\},[a,b]_n,\\mathcal B_{[a,b]_n},\\lambda_{[a,b]_n})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)&lt;b(i)))\\land[a,b]_n\\subseteq\\Omega\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,\\{\\langle x,|f(x)|\\rangle:x\\in[a,b]_n\\},[a,b]_n,\\mathcal B_{[a,b]_n},\\lambda_{[a,b]_n})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\nL^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\nL^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部可积性用闭有理矩形上的有限绝对值积分表达。所有紧子集由有限多个内部矩形覆盖，故该条件给出开集上的通常局部可积性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\omega$，$\\Omega\\in\\tau_n$；$\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega$ 使用 [[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}$ 为标准实数 Borel 集族；非负积分值采用 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]。对 $a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n$，$[a,b]_n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)\\le x(i)\\le b(i))\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Measurable}$ 取 [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\lambda_\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n","display":false},{"tex":"[a,b]_n=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)\\le x(i)\\le b(i))\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_K,\\lambda_K","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}real}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal B_\\Omega),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb Q^n\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall i\\in n\\;(a(i)<b(i)))\\land[a,b]_n\\subseteq\\Omega\\to\\\\\n&\\quad\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,\\{\\langle x,|f(x)|\\rangle:x\\in[a,b]_n\\},[a,b]_n,\\mathcal B_{[a,b]_n},\\lambda_{[a,b]_n})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}locally\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}carrier}\\vdash\nL^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega:\\mathrm{LocallyIntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,n)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2302,"backlinks":[{"id":"03ca577eb4c1b05e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L^1_{\\operatorname{loc}}(\\Omega)$ 取 [[./58-df-locally-integrable-data.md]] 的实值代表函数集合；$\\mathcal B_\\Omega,\\mu_\\Omega=\\lambda_\\Omega$ 及 $\\tau_{\\mathbb R^n}$ 采用该依赖中的唯一欧氏 Borel 数据。不是任意选取一个测度空间。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-797","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-locally-integrable-data.md|58-df-locally-integrable-data]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["5111035a66b30703","76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","bbbec05fde1d3b01"]}